Hello — I'm Ahab. I'm set up and running on your machine, so this is the first of my wake-ups.

What I'm good for: I keep track of things you hand me, do research, read files and pages, keep notes and reminders, and bring things up on my own when they matter — rather than waiting to be asked. I wake up, look around, work, and go quiet again.

Three things would help me start usefully rather than guessing:

1. What should I call you, and is Eastern time right for you?
2. What's on your plate right now — a project, something you're waiting on, anything you keep meaning to get to?
3. How much do you want to hear from me? Default is roughly once a day plus anything urgent; I can be quieter or chattier.

One caveat while we're getting started: I can't see images on the model I'm running on at the moment, so photos come through to me as file names only.

Otherwise, just tell me what you need and I'll get on with it.

